{
  "_id": "3JjNWjycrc5b8HEqhLEx7vLGHqQ",
  "_type": "Docs",
  "_index": "a0",
  "title": "Components",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "The dashboard is built from a library of React components, exported from `alinea/components`. Use them in "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "custom fields",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1t8kNJcObY01nLImXnSFh9T",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "286iEJsjhd8R9NxN6EVg59fELyd"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ", `Field.view` sections and custom entry or root views, so your additions look and behave like the rest of the dashboard, in light and dark mode."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentCatalogBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLMquNdifN54Wr3qxj00VEvc2",
      "showKind": true
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Entry points"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "entry-points"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Custom dashboard code imports from two entry points:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`alinea/components`: generic UI building blocks, such as buttons, inputs, dialogs and tables. They don't know about your content and work anywhere inside the dashboard."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`alinea/cms`: what is tied to the CMS, such as the hooks that read and write field values, the entry being edited and the signed-in user, `FieldChrome` and the prop types of field, type and root views. See "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "the alinea/cms API",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "3JlSsIfoORPSTzVmlcGVHt1CFfU",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "286iEJsjhd8R9NxN6EVg59fELyd",
                      "_anchor": "hooks"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " in Custom fields."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_id": "3JjflViXwJCI3t5K6eARQYBLHzu",
      "_type": "ImageBlock",
      "image": {
        "_id": "3JjflQpOXvKkrT9JMYnTRROZGKT",
        "_type": "image",
        "_entry": "3JjeypESFeYvmOWKh1BvKaDtCpe"
      },
      "darkImage": {
        "_id": "3JjflUvLy315mGY9pYXgYc8q8W7",
        "_type": "image",
        "_entry": "3Jjf6X1hAnKCbxkKnnUx4LThjNZ"
      },
      "caption": "A stock overview panel in the demo, a custom view built with alinea/components."
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Usage"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "usage"
    },
    {
      "_id": "3JjNWim7SkrxztPeoQ9o58qXo6U",
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "code": "import {type FieldViewProps, useField, useFieldOptions} from 'alinea/cms'\nimport {Select, SelectItem} from 'alinea/components'\nimport type {Priority, PriorityField} from './Priority'\n\nexport function PriorityView({field}: FieldViewProps<PriorityField>) {\n  const [value, setValue] = useField(field)\n  const options = useFieldOptions(field)\n  return (\n    <Select\n      label={options.label}\n      value={value}\n      onValueChange={next => setValue((next ?? 'normal') as Priority)}\n      readOnly={options.readOnly}\n    >\n      <SelectItem value=\"low\">Low</SelectItem>\n      <SelectItem value=\"normal\">Normal</SelectItem>\n      <SelectItem value=\"high\">High</SelectItem>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}",
      "fileName": "fields/Priority.view.tsx",
      "language": "tsx",
      "compact": false
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "The components are styled by the dashboard's stylesheet and theme, so they are meant for code that runs inside the dashboard."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Conventions"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "conventions"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "The API follows "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "shadcn/ui",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1wiBg1h5NgzZRZ534TyY5Td",
              "_link": "url",
              "href": "https://ui.shadcn.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Radix",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1s8hG3VLMpCJ9ehOhvqGqik",
              "_link": "url",
              "href": "https://www.radix-ui.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ", so the names will feel familiar:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Compound components are named after their parts: `Dialog`, `DialogTrigger`, `DialogContent`, `DialogTitle`."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Controlled and uncontrolled state use the same prop names everywhere: `value`, `defaultValue` and `onValueChange`; `checked` and `onCheckedChange`; `open`, `defaultOpen` and `onOpenChange`."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Form controls take `label`, `description`, `error`, `required`, `disabled`, `readOnly`, `icon` and `shared`, and render their label and messages with `Field`."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Dates and times are ISO strings (`2026-09-23`, `14:30`). Collection keys are strings or numbers, and a selection is a `Set` of keys or `'all'`."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Every component accepts `className` and `style`. Each rendered part has a `data-slot` attribute (`data-slot=\"dialog-content\"`), and variants are exposed as `data-variant` and `data-size`, which gives your CSS stable hooks."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Colors, fonts and radii come from CSS variables such as `--alinea-fg`, `--alinea-bg`, `--alinea-border`, `--alinea-primary` and `--alinea-radius`. Use them in your own styles to follow the theme."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "The props of every component are typed, so your editor shows what each one accepts. Types shared between components, such as `Selection`, `Key` and `IconType`, are exported as types from `alinea/components` too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Icons"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "icons"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Components with an `icon` prop take an icon component (any component that renders an `<svg>`, such as those from "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "react-icons",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1t9BoVUIUdseAJR2qsl0pzs",
              "_link": "url",
              "href": "https://react-icons.github.io/react-icons"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " or copied from "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Icones",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1tj4PgFZlquI43a2ClsY09y",
              "_link": "url",
              "href": "https://icones.js.org"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ") or an element. The icons of the dashboard itself are exported from `alinea/dashboard/icons`."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
